IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ia71-types`
IMPORT `ia71-status`
IMPORT `ia71-offences`
IMPORT `ia71-goal`

-- Immigration Act 1971 (UK) — the encoder's tests. Expected values are
-- worked by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

-- Fields: British, pre-1983 Commonwealth RoA, still Commonwealth, Irish,
-- deported/excluded, local journey.
british MEANS `Person facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
foreign MEANS `Person facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
irish MEANS `Person facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
excludedIrish MEANS `Person facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE

§§ `Goal 1 — right of abode and the need for leave`

#ASSERT `has the right of abode` british
#ASSERT `has the right of abode` (`Person facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`has the right of abode` (`Person facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`requires leave to enter` british)
#ASSERT `requires leave to enter` foreign
#ASSERT NOT (`requires leave to enter` irish)
#ASSERT `requires leave to enter` excludedIrish
#ASSERT NOT (`requires leave to enter` (`Person facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE))
#ASSERT `requires leave to enter` (`Person facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)

§§ `Goal 2 — continuation of leave`

-- Leave expires 31 March 2026; applied 30 March; decided 15 May; appeal
-- rights end 29 May.
GIVEN applied IS A DATE, decided IS A MAYBE DATE, rights IS A MAYBE DATE, left IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Leave extension facts`
`leave to 31 March 2026, applied` applied `, decided` decided `, rights end` rights `, left` left MEANS
    `Leave extension facts` OF Date 31 3 2026, applied, decided, rights, left

typical MEANS `leave to 31 March 2026, applied` (Date 30 3 2026) `, decided` (JUST (Date 15 5 2026)) `, rights end` (JUST (Date 29 5 2026)) `, left` NOTHING
#ASSERT `the leave is extended by s 3C under` typical `on` (Date 1 4 2026)
#ASSERT `the leave is extended by s 3C under` typical `on` (Date 20 5 2026)
#ASSERT `the leave is extended by s 3C under` typical `on` (Date 29 5 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`the leave is extended by s 3C under` typical `on` (Date 30 5 2026))
-- Applied on the expiry day counts; the day after does not.
#ASSERT `the leave is extended by s 3C under` (`leave to 31 March 2026, applied` (Date 31 3 2026) `, decided` NOTHING `, rights end` NOTHING `, left` NOTHING) `on` (Date 1 6 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`the leave is extended by s 3C under` (`leave to 31 March 2026, applied` (Date 1 4 2026) `, decided` NOTHING `, rights end` NOTHING `, left` NOTHING) `on` (Date 1 6 2026))
-- Decided before expiry: s 3C does not apply.
#ASSERT NOT (`the leave is extended by s 3C under` (`leave to 31 March 2026, applied` (Date 1 3 2026) `, decided` (JUST (Date 20 3 2026)) `, rights end` (JUST (Date 3 4 2026)) `, left` NOTHING) `on` (Date 2 4 2026))
-- s 3C(3): left on 10 April.
#ASSERT NOT (`the leave is extended by s 3C under` (`leave to 31 March 2026, applied` (Date 30 3 2026) `, decided` NOTHING `, rights end` NOTHING `, left` (JUST (Date 10 4 2026))) `on` (Date 10 4 2026))

§§ `Goal 3 — offences`

GIVEN k IS AN `Offence`, j IS A `Jurisdiction`
GIVETH AN `Offence facts`
`offence` k `in` j MEANS
    `Offence facts` OF k, Date 15 1 2026, j, 12, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING

#ASSERT `the maximum on indictment for` (`offence` `entering in breach of a deportation order (A1)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS `months` 60
#ASSERT `the maximum on indictment for` (`offence` `entering without leave (B1)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS `months` 48
#ASSERT `the maximum on indictment for` (`offence` `endangering life on a journey by water, with an (A1) offence (E1A)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS `months` 72
#ASSERT `the maximum on indictment for` (`offence` `endangering life on a journey by water, with a (B1), (D1) or (E1) offence (E1A)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS `months` 60
#ASSERT `the maximum on indictment for` (`offence` `illegal working (24B)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS `not triable on indictment`
#ASSERT `the maximum on summary conviction for` (`offence` `entering without leave (B1)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS `months` 12
#ASSERT `the maximum on summary conviction for` (`Offence facts` OF `entering without leave (B1)`, Date 15 1 2022, `England and Wales`, 12, TRUE, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING) EQUALS `months` 6
#ASSERT `the maximum on summary conviction for` (`offence` `entering without leave (B1)` `in` `Scotland`) EQUALS `months` 12
#ASSERT `the maximum on summary conviction for` (`offence` `entering without leave (B1)` `in` `Northern Ireland`) EQUALS `months` 6
#ASSERT `the maximum on summary conviction for` (`offence` `illegal working (24B)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS `weeks` 51
#ASSERT `the maximum on summary conviction for` (`offence` `illegal working (24B)` `in` `Scotland`) EQUALS `months` 6
#ASSERT `the maximum on summary conviction for` (`offence` `failing to observe a condition of leave (1)(b)` `in` `Scotland`) EQUALS `months` 6

-- s 28(1)(a): offence 15 January 2026; six months after: 15 July 2026.
-- Evidence certified 1 October 2027: two months after is 1 December 2027,
-- within three years (15 January 2029).
#ASSERT `the last day to lay an information for` (`offence` `entering without leave (B1)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS JUST (Date 15 7 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to lay an information for` (`Offence facts` OF `entering without leave (B1)`, Date 15 1 2026, `England and Wales`, 12, FALSE, FALSE, JUST (Date 1 10 2027), NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 12 2027)
#ASSERT `the last day to lay an information for` (`Offence facts` OF `entering without leave (B1)`, Date 15 1 2026, `England and Wales`, 12, FALSE, FALSE, JUST (Date 1 12 2028), NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 15 1 2029)
#ASSERT `the last day to lay an information for` (`Offence facts` OF `entering without leave (B1)`, Date 15 1 2026, `England and Wales`, 12, FALSE, FALSE, JUST (Date 1 2 2026), NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 15 7 2026)
-- s 28(1A)(a): bail breach 15 January 2026; six months beginning end
-- 14 July 2026; arrest 1 July 2026: three months end 30 September 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to lay an information for` (`Offence facts` OF `breaching an immigration bail condition (1)(h)`, Date 15 1 2026, `England and Wales`, 12, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, JUST (Date 1 7 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 30 9 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to lay an information for` (`Offence facts` OF `breaching an immigration bail condition (1)(h)`, Date 15 1 2026, `England and Wales`, 12, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 14 7 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to lay an information for` (`offence` `overstaying (C1)` `in` `England and Wales`) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `The top-level goal`

pos MEANS `the immigration position for` (`Immigration case` OF foreign, JUST typical, Date 20 5 2026, JUST (`offence` `entering without leave (B1)` `in` `Scotland`))
#ASSERT NOT (pos's `right of abode`)
#ASSERT pos's `requires leave to enter`
#ASSERT pos's `leave extended by s 3C on the day` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT pos's `maximum on summary conviction` EQUALS JUST (`months` 12)
